?INCLUDE 'sE9_mansion_intro'
sE9_mansion_intro.dialogstring_08FCBE! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]When I came to, I was[N]standing at the entrance[N]of a mysterious mansion.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sEA_solid_arm'
sEA_solid_arm.dialogstring_08FA31! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Welcome to my mansion.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Gem the jewel merchant was[N]a temporary form. My true[N]form is called Solid Arm.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]I was beaten by Soul[N]Blader back when he[N]descended from the[N]heavens.[FIN]After that, I slept for a[N]long, long time…[FIN]My power was sealed in Red[N]Jewels which were[N]scattered throughout the[N]world.[FIN]So, I did whatever I could[N]to have myself[N]resurrected.[FIN]I was even the one on the[N]other side of the curtain,[N]pulling the strings of the[N]slave trade.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][SFX:10]I used slave labour to[N]search for the jewels, but[N]I didn't think I would[N]take back my power so[N]quickly…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]As my thanks to you, I'll[N]let you rest in peace![END]`

?INCLUDE 'game_over_sequence'
game_over_sequence.dialogstring_00D7C2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: When I came to, I[N]found that I had collapsed[N]in a familiar place. Was I[N]having a nightmare?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sEA_solid_arm'
sEA_solid_arm.dialogstring_08FBC8! `[SFX:10][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]I can hear a faint voice…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10][DLY:4]It has been done once[N]again…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10][DLY:4]Soul Blader was strong[N]too, but I think you are[N]even stronger…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10][DLY:4]Danger is approaching this[N]planet. Well, you should[N]return to the Tower of[N]Babel and hurry on…[END]`
